.Dd November 09, 2026
.Dt SW_VERS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm sw_vers
.Nd print system version information
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl --productName | --productVersion | --productVersionExtra | --buildVersion
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints system version information for the currently running operating system on the local machine.

When invoked without options,
.Nm
prints a short list of version properties:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
% sw_vers
ProductName:              Ubuntu
ProductVersion:           26.10
ProductVersionExtra:      (a)
BuildVersion:             26A100

.Ed
The
.Sy ProductName
property provides the name of the operating system release .
The
.Sy ProductVersion
property defines the version of the operating system release (for example,
.Sy 24.04
or
.Sy 26.10 ) .
The
.Sy ProductVersionExtra
property
is always set to
.Sy (a)
for compatibility with the macOS implementation .
The
.Sy BuildVersion
property provides the specific revision of the operating system as assigned by the build system.
.Sh OPTIONS
The output of
.Nm
can be refined by the following options.
These long-form options can also be passed in lowercase for convenience.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl --productName
Print only the value of the
.Sy ProductName
property.
.It Fl --productVersion
Print only the value of the
.Sy ProductVersion
property.
.It Fl --productVersionExtra
Print only the value of the
.Sy ProductVersionExtra
property.
.It Fl --buildVersion
Print only the value of the
.Sy BuildVersion
property.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Print the product name:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
% sw_vers --productName
Ubuntu
.Ed
.Pp
Print the product version:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
% sw_vers --productVersion
26.10
.Ed
.Pp
Print the product version extra:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
% sw_vers --productVersionExtra
(a)
.Ed
.Pp
Print the build version:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
% sw_vers --buildVersion
26A100
.Ed
.Sh COMPATIBILITY
.Nm
is backwards compatible with previous versions which expect options passed with a single dash, as in:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
% sw_vers -productName
.Ed
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /etc/os-release
Contains the operating system identification and version information.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr uname 1 ,
.Xr machine 1
